        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "For many, it’s nice to get a table at the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Sydney Opera House",
            "zh": "悉尼歌剧院"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "outdoor dining area",
            "zh": "就餐区"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " during the summer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "At one time, the diners really had to watch out for the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "seagulls",
            "zh": "海鸥"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The birds would quietly stand behind them, waiting for the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "perfect",
            "ref": "v-perfect"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " time... to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "steal",
            "ref": "v-steal"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their food! Some of the birds didn’t even wait for the diners to walk away."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The opera house tried many ways to keep these hungry birds away, but none of them worked. Then it "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "turned out",
            "zh": "结果,证明是"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that all they needed were some... DOGS!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A group of dogs were "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "trained",
            "zh": "训练"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "chase",
            "ref": "v-chase"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " away seagulls for the diners. At first, the dogs had to be everywhere. After "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "a few",
            "ref": "v-a-few"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " weeks, the seagulls knew that they "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "couldn’t help themselves to",
            "ref": "v-help"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the food. Now, only one dog needs to be put in "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "action",
            "ref": "v-action"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Thank you, good boys and good girls!"
          }
        ]
      },
